# Ashlight — Unity 6 LTS

## Language
Always use C# for Unity scripts. Target Unity 6 LTS API only.

## Namespaces
Use namespace `Ashlight.[Module]` for all scripts.

## Patterns
Prefer composition over inheritance. Use ScriptableObjects for data.

## Singletons
Use `GameManager` as the only singleton. Everything else uses dependency injection or events.

## Events
Use Unity Events and C# events for decoupled communication between systems.

## Null checks
Always null-check component references in `Start()` and `Awake()`.

## Comments
Add XML doc comments to all public methods and properties.

## Testing
All new MonoBehaviours must have a corresponding test class.

## Performance
Avoid `GetComponent` in `Update()`. Cache in `Awake()`/`Start()`.

## Coroutines
Prefer coroutines for timed effects. Use async/await for file I/O only.
